messages.en:
{07 00 00}I try not to buy something
unless I really like it.{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}Especially furniture.
{06 01 00 0d 0e 0f}

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Ma püüan mitte osta asja,
kui see mulle ei meeldi.{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 15 00}Eriti mööblit.
{06 01 00 0d 0e 0f}

messages.en:
{07 14 00}You can change the whole
feel of a room by replacing
the carpet and walls.
{07 19 00}When you've been dumped,{01 00 00 0a 00}
might I suggest this over
cutting your hair?{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Sa võid muuta kogu toa
tunnet, kui vahetad
vaiba ja seinad.
{07 19 00}Kui sind on maha jäetud,{01 00 00 0a 00}
soovitaksin seda juuste
lõikamise asemel.{07 00 00}

messages.en:
{07 0b 00}Have you ever heard of {01 00 00 0a 00}
{ff 00 00 06}K.K. Slider{ff 00 00 00}?{02 00 00 08 09}
Duh!
Who?

messages.et:
{07 0b 00}Kas sa oled kuulnud {01 00 00 0a 00}
{ff 00 00 06}K.K. Sliderist{ff 00 00 00}?{02 00 00 08 09}
Muidugi!
Kellest?

messages.en:
{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}I love furniture so much{01 00 00 0a 00} 
that sometimes I dream
about it, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.
{06 01 00 0a 0b 0c}

messages.et:
{07 0e 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Armastan mööblit nii väga,{01 00 00 0a 00}
et vahel näen sellest
und, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.
{06 01 00 0a 0b 0c}

messages.en:
{07 14 00}He's totally awesome. {01 00 00 0a 00}I said
that I wanted a song that
would suit my house,
and he wrote one for me! {07 13 00}I
couldn't believe it!{01 01 00}
{07 19 00}He's a genius, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!{07 00 00}

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Ta on vinge. {01 00 00 0a 00}Ütlesin,
et tahan laulu, mis
sobiks mu majaga,
ja ta kirjutas mulle ühe! {07 13 00}Ma
ei suutnud uskuda!{01 01 00}
{07 19 00}Ta on geenius, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}!{07 00 00}

messages.en:
{07 15 00}I won't have {ff 00 00 06}Tom Nook{ff 00 00 00} or
the {ff 00 00 02}Happy Room Academy{ff 00 00 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}
tell me what to do!

messages.et:
{07 15 00}Ma ei lase {ff 00 00 06}Tom Nookil{ff 00 00 00} ega
{ff 00 00 02}Kauni Kodu Akadeemial{ff 00 00 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}
endale öelda, mida teha!
